                        ],
                        [
                            "wroth",
                            "+1 Stewardship"
                        ]
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Next event is Arrival at Mecca in 10 days."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "Arrival at Mecca",
            "level": 2,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "50% chance of either Wudu (+10 Piety) or Ihram (+15 Piety) events. Both leads to Tawaf event (+25 Piety) with the following options:"
                },
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "A If proud , become ambitious . Otherwise 33% chance of becoming proud .",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "B Become humble .",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Next event in 2 days is one the next 4:"
                },
                {
                    "type": "table",
                    "rows": [
                        [
                            "Sa'i",
                            "+1 Health (only once per character, +25 Piety otherwise)"
                        ],
                        [
                            "Wuquf at Mount Ararat",
                            "+50 Piety"
                        ],
                        [
                            "Ramy al-Jamarat (Stoning the Devil)",
                            "+15 Piety, lose lunatic , stressed , depressed . If possessed , lose possessed , voice of satan, jesus, holy comet, lycanthropy, demon child (real or fake), child exorcism modifiers and flags."
                        ],
                        [
                            "Eid al-Adha",
                            "Spend 10% yearly income to gain 25 Prestige OR spend 5% yearly income to gain 15 Piety"
                        ]
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Hajj ends in 10-35 days (30-55 days if further away from Mecca). Gain Hajjaj ."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "Events on the way home",
            "level": 2,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "All have a mtth of 60 days. only 1 of these events can happen per Hajj."
                },
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "Pilgrim Remains , gain 15 Piety",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "Sandstorm , gain 15 Piety",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "Stranded Pilgrims",
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "text": "Lose 10% yearly income, gain 15 Piety",
                                    "children": []
                                },
                                {
                                    "text": "Lose -15 Piety",
                                    "children": []
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "Hashshashins requires saved_assassin flag, mtth of 15 days, gain 20 Prestige",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
